{"code":"025890","name":"한국주강","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"철강","sector_desc":"철강재 생산·가공. 중국 공급, 원료(철광석·석탄) 가격, 건설·조선 수요에 연동되는 경기 민감 업종입니다.","desc":"동사는 1987년 설립, 1997년 유가증권시장 상장된 주강 제조업체로, 국내 4개 계열사를 보유하고 있음. 연간 최대 12,000톤의 주강품을 생산하며, 조선용, 산업기계용, 발전설비용 주강품을 제공하는 국내 주조업계 상위 제조업체임. 9개 글로벌 선급 인증을 보유하고 NORSOK 등 특수강종 인증을 추진하며 발전, 해상플랜트, 방산, 해상풍력 분야로 포트폴리오를 확대하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-30","n_days":300,"close":2440.0,"open":2500.0,"high":2500.0,"low":2410.0,"volume":8800,"amount":21472000.0,"ret_1d":-1.8109,"gap":0.6036,"range_pct":3.6885,"ret_5":-2.008,"ret_20":-8.9552,"ret_60":6.5502,"ret_120":10.6576,"ret_250":26.7532,"ma20":2550.5,"ma60":2549.75,"ma120":2330.4,"ma200":2129.22,"close_vs_ma200":14.596,"close_vs_ma60":-4.3043,"ma_align":1,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":17.5864,"r2_60":0.0998,"slope_120":97.0675,"r2_120":0.764,"slope_250":61.8518,"r2_250":0.7571,"high52":2900.0,"low52":1494.0,"pos_52w":67.2831,"dd_52w":-15.8621,"mdd_1y":-31.3318,"atr14_pct":4.3911,"vol_ann_60":29.4153,"vol_avg20":10042.4,"vol_ratio20":0.8763,"vr5":0.1733,"vr20":0.181,"amount_avg5":16478293.0,"amount_avg20":25768597.0,"amount_avg60":94110339.75,"obv_chg20":-71.3405,"turnover_20":1.8022,"pv_eff_20":-4.9691,"rsi14":39.4678,"frgn_net_5":-6591.0,"inst_net_5":-164.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0591,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0015,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0606,"frgn_net_20":3181.0,"inst_net_20":64.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0285,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0006,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0291,"frgn_net_60":11648.0,"inst_net_60":7649.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.1045,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0686,"smart_net_60_pct":0.1732,"frgn_net_120":-46851.0,"inst_net_120":13844.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.4204,"inst_net_120_pct":0.1242,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.2962,"foreign_ratio":4.83,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.21,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":2.0,"op_margin_q":1.8018,"op_qoq":100.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-50.0,"rev_yoy":-5.1282,"op_trend_4q":84.4444,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-1.46,"debt_ratio":29.65,"per":null,"pbr":0.81,"div_yield":null,"for